{"4529360": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bus Manager 26", "steam_appid": 4529360, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the bus network of any city you choose and build an efficient public transport system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick any city in the world and gradually develop your network. Buy buses, place stops, plan routes, and transport passengers across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a transport network isn’t just about placing routes. You also need to manage your finances, optimize your lines, and adapt your network to passenger demand to avoid losses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision affects the balance of your company. Too many buses and your costs rise. Too few and passengers start piling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your fleet, improve your routes, and build a network capable of moving an entire city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in any city in the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and manage your fleet of buses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place bus stops and create routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport passengers across the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your company’s income and expenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your network to make it more efficient</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take control of the bus network of any city you choose and build an efficient public transport system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick any city in the world and gradually develop your network. Buy buses, place stops, plan routes, and transport passengers across the city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Running a transport network isn’t just about placing routes. You also need to manage your finances, optimize your lines, and adapt your network to passenger demand to avoid losses.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every decision affects the balance of your company. Too many buses and your costs rise. Too few and passengers start piling up.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your fleet, improve your routes, and build a network capable of moving an entire city.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play in any city in the world</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy and manage your fleet of buses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place bus stops and create routes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Transport passengers across the city</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manage your company’s income and expenses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize your network to make it more efficient</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Manage the bus network of any city you choose. Buy buses, place stops, plan routes, and transport passengers while keeping your company financially stable in cities all around the world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Spanish - Spain<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Traditional Chinese<strong>*</strong>, Korean<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Polish<strong>*</strong>, Portuguese - Portugal<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, Thai<strong>*</strong>, Turkish<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529360/15834514afa70349ba3c0a1f28f9fcf84082086c/header.jpg?t=1782937812", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529360/d5b4cdb54c3c62565d0ea346be8829fb11460594/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1782937812", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4529360/d5b4cdb54c3c62565d0ea346be8829fb11460594/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=17829378